invalid type: string "Bharat Darshan Park in Punjabi Bagh, opened in phases from late 2021 by the Delhi municipal corporation, presents replicas of iconic Indian monuments — including the Taj Mahal, Qutub Minar, Charminar, Konark Sun Temple wheel, Gateway of India, Hampi chariot, Mysore Palace, Meenakshi Temple and Nalanda ruins — fabricated from around 350 tonnes of scrap metal. It extends th